contentText:
As far as current pop music goes, Role Model is probably Maine&#8217;s most famous export &#8212; but what about celebrities in general?

While guesting on the Friday (Oct. 2) premiere episode of Amelia Dimoldenberg&#8217;s final season of &#8220;Chicken Shop Date,&#8221; the singer born Tucker Pillsbury pondered whether he has the most star power out of everyone from his home state. &#8220;Anna Kendrick&#8217;s from Maine,&#8221; he pointed out, while the show&#8217;s host noted that famed horror author Stephen King is also from the Pine Tree State.

